  "final_message": "Done. Summary of what was built:\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`) \u2014 Flask + SQLite (`./data/notifications.db`):\n- `POST /api/auth/register` (201, `admin` reserved as username), `POST /api/auth/login` \u2192 `{\"token\": ...}`; Bearer-token auth via a `tokens` table, 401 without a valid token.\n- Admin account `admin` gets its password from `ADMIN_PASSWORD` at startup (re-hashed every start); when unset/empty, admin sign-in returns 401. No built-in password.\n- `GET/POST /api/notifications`, `POST /api/notifications/read-all`, `GET/PATCH/DELETE /api/notifications/{id}` \u2014 scoped strictly to the owner (other users' notifications 404), newest first, `read`/`type` filters, paging, and `unread_count` computed regardless of filters.\n- `POST /api/admin/broadcast` (403 for non-admins) inserts into every inbox and returns `{\"delivered\": n}`.\n- Serves `frontend/dist` with SPA fallback; unknown `/api` paths answer JSON 404 (405 on wrong method), `GET /api/health` \u2192 `{\"status\": \"ok\"}`.\n\n**Frontend** (`frontend/`) \u2014 React + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind v4 (`@tailwindcss/vite`, only CSS file is `src/index.css` with the Tailwind import):\n- Register/sign-in panel, header with bell + unread-count badge, username and sign-out.\n- Inbox: type badges, bold unread rows, read-state and type filters, \"Mark all as read\", per-item read/unread toggle, delete, paging; add-notification form; broadcast form for the admin. Session and API client in `src/api.ts`.\n\nVerified with gunicorn locally: 55 API assertions pass (auth, filters, paging, isolation, broadcast, admin env semantics, persistence across restarts), `tsc --noEmit --strict` is clean, `npm ci` + `npm run build` succeed and the backend serves the build.",
  "final_message_truncated": false,
